{"title":"Stormglass","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Stormglass is a named <a href=\"#/monster/sand-elemental\">Sand Elemental</a> seen at level 42.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Stormglass</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2039, 1210</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"stormglass\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-torso\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b8462ae309e7613f97c6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/7fd45a0197a0daf36551.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Stormglass</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/sand-elemental\">Sand Elemental</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>42</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>636</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}